			<id>{07C01B20-4EE9-4513-A7C7-D7D8882ADC7E}</id>
			<name>locket</name>
			<text><![CDATA[MY MOTHER'S LOCKET IS GONE. TOMAS HAS BEEN PLAYING WITH IT AGAIN, I KNOW HE HAS. HE WILL NOT TELL ME WHERE HE PUT IT.]]></text>
